{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Introduction</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Attention, players:</strong> <br>Certain sensitive, risqu\u00e9 scenes have been removed, which may cause some story transitions to feel a bit disjointed.<br>The ranking page has not been developed yet and is not available!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>\u201cSummer Homestay\u201d</strong>!<br>College student <strong>Li Lei</strong>, in pursuit of internship credits, unexpectedly finds himself working as a summer helper at a seaside guesthouse. What seemed like an ordinary part-time job quickly spirals into a lively comedy as he encounters four very different female lodgers\u2014a strict English teacher, a childhood friend, a mischievous girl, and a tsundere heiress. From hilarious misunderstandings to intense cooking showdowns, get ready for a chaotic yet heart-warming summer rom-com adventure!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Four Heroines</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Han Meimei\uff5cThe Gap-Moe Teacher</strong><br><i>Comedy setup:</i> Outwardly a serious and strict English tutor, but in reality a hopeless disaster in everyday life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Xiaomei\uff5cStraightforward Childhood Friend on the Rampage</strong><br><i>Comedy setup:</i> Self-proclaimed \u201csweet but not dumb girl of the guesthouse.\u201d</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chana\uff5cThe Little Devil Cosplay Master</strong><br><i>Comedy setup:</i> Loves taking photos with the player, her catchphrase is <i>\u201cLi Lei, you big dummy!\u201d</i> and she has an unusual passion for insect cuisine.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Liuli\uff5cThe Tsundere Heiress</strong><br><i>Comedy setup:</i> Arrives with a whole arsenal, declaring she wants to \u201cexperience commoner life.\u201d She even orders the player to use \u201csuperpowers\u201d when chopping vegetables.</p><